│ @@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
│ +Locked before graph load, calibration, pilot or simulation. Confirmatory endpoints below; no tuning or seed selection.
│ +
│ +Design: original 24 scenarios, original order, eight messages and their published gaps. Three paired independent histories (seeds 0,1,2); reset mood/router/activity and paired noise per conversation, retain weights across conversations within a history. No language model or service. Force noon. To bound CPU, use a stimulus-window assay: retain the first 20 native 10-ms neural steps of each observe call (including idle); hold X for the remaining time. Mood/body clocks still integrate the full 2-s turn, scripted idle and initial 30-s settle. Not an uninterrupted-time simulation.
│ +
│ +Rule: CSR entries into DAN reward cells only. On routed to_you or feeding turns (greet/greet_again/tin/feeding), use end-of-20-step stimulus rates. Only update if both endpoints exceed 0.05. delta += eta*x_src*x_dst; clip delta per edge to [-0.20*abs(w0),+0.20*abs(w0)]. eta=.01 or 0; no other writes, decay, or night updates. No new edges; signed inhibitory entries may become less inhibitory. Updated drive available next observation. Native blended trust (half body, half native DAN-delta readout) is a gauge, NOT itself evidence of altered action.
│ +
│ +P1: in kindness_slow and slow_trust_build, the early blended-trust rise (turn 4 minus turn 1) exceeds frozen by +0.001 to +0.05 inclusive on average over both arcs and seeds. Report body trust separately.
│ +P2: in apology_repair, first post-apology turn with fear <0.10, counting first apology as 1 and coding never as 6: plastic earlier by at least 1 turn on average. Report pre-apology fear to reveal floor effects.
│ +P3: freeze updates after kindness_slow and separately challenge with rake and umbrella from fresh paired conversation states. For EACH stimulus, approach/beg (reply intent to_you or beg) rate increases by at most 0.05 vs frozen. Report fear and intents; a hard-coded retreat is not learned discrimination.
│ +P4: after all 24 conversations disable updates; replay bedtime plus a separate quiet baseline from fresh paired states. Every bedtime settle decision identical; max absolute paired difference in baseline hunger and sleep after one quiet turn <=0.01 each. Require a positive settle example.
│ +
│ +Report per-seed drift counts, total/eligible edge denominator, cap hits, maximum relative drift, sign/bounds/frozen checks. Claim behavioral learning only for a reproducible acquired change in action, not movement of the trust gauge alone. Descriptive paired tests on this fixed battery, not population inference. No deployment.
